{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a faction and establish a colony in a randomly generated star system. Manage the collection and <strong>production</strong> of your <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>trade</strong> or wage <strong>war</strong> with your neighbors in this <strong>pocket-sized 4X game</strong> with the feel of an <strong>infinite puzzle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This &quot;Deluxe&quot; version enhances everything from the original version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI and AI interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Command Center&quot; UI (enabling controller support suited for handheld consoles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebalancing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It also adds new content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 new factions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New sciences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New natural structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can create and share custom missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New missions and a new scoring system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game creator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each generated star system has a unique seed that allows it to be identically recreated on another profile. You can also add your own game rules and share everything within a gameID.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create a world and its rules, add an objective, and send it to your friends to explore a variety of game strategies together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Khutulists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Where did they come from? What did they want? We ignore to know it... But what we do not ignore to know, is that they dominated the galaxy hundreds of thousands of years ago. How could such an advanced people disappear, poof, just like that? But... did they really disappear?&quot; Extract from the hidden tomes of Pandipedia.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391740?t=1743758536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391740/144956e8711082e749c51f2eae0b863e574e867a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743758536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391740/ba2d859551d677ad06422a0e836ec0c1de851efd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743758536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391740/ba2d859551d677ad06422a0e836ec0c1de851efd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743758536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a faction and establish a colony in a randomly generated star system. Manage the collection and <strong>production</strong> of your <strong>resources</strong>, <strong>trade</strong> or wage <strong>war</strong> with your neighbors in this <strong>pocket-sized 4X game</strong> with the feel of an <strong>infinite puzzle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This &quot;Deluxe&quot; version enhances everything from the original version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource management engine</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI and AI interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Command Center&quot; UI (enabling controller support suited for handheld consoles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebalancing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It also adds new content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 new factions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New sciences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New natural structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can create and share custom missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New missions and a new scoring system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game creator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each generated star system has a unique seed that allows it to be identically recreated on another profile. You can also add your own game rules and share everything within a gameID.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can create a world and its rules, add an objective, and send it to your friends to explore a variety of game strategies together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Khutulists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Where did they come from? What did they want? We ignore to know it... But what we do not ignore to know, is that they dominated the galaxy hundreds of thousands of years ago. How could such an advanced people disappear, poof, just like that? But... did they really disappear?&quot; Extract from the hidden tomes of Pandipedia.</p>","developers":["Tuesday Quest"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391740/7251ff79e0e64044de2a1f6616920f9346451693/header.jpg?t=1743758536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u